  "facts": [
    "The Firespitter is a defensive building unlocked at Town Hall level 17. It attacks by firing a hail of small molten iron balls at enemies in a straight line. These projectiles do a small amount of damage, but come in bursts of 20 shots and can hit two targets each."
  ],
